    "title": "St. Pete, Our City of the Arts: Making the Dream Stay Alive - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By AA Catalyst ,\n1 days ago St. Petersburg is known for its murals, music, theater, symphonies, dance, and world-class museums like the Dalí and the MFA, alongside dozens of unique forms of artistic expression. The arts, in the fullest sense of the word, are the vitality and soul of a community. Yet, Florida’s Amendment 3 on the November ballot threatens to undermine and erode the very foundation of that culture. Read full article",
